    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_with">ci: kuaar ba bɔ ci ri ba kuoth kɔc ci wuok, kʊt ba tan ci kʊt ba kit.</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_without">ga ci: bluetooth kuaar nyin ba ri ba kuoth. kuoth ba gat ci ri ke, ci o tee later ka android’s app settings.</string>
